Z||000000||The Fieromaster||07-05-2001||02:46 AM||||I have my car rear end all up in the air with no cradle and am wondering... Has anyone taken all the fiberglass(?) insulation out of their cars?  I think that removing it and painting the firewall and all might make it look pretty good!  Whats the pros and cons of removing it?  If its just a sound difference im not worried... i like the roar!<P>Thanks all  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>      "Raced That Wrecked Better"<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">    <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||5
Z||000001||Haze_Performance||07-05-2001||03:08 AM||||I've seen a lot of Fieros with the glass removed. I just pulled most of it out of my '85. The only side effect is going to be noise. Without it, it will be louder. (No biggie)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/haze8588logo.gif">        </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>Pennock's Fiero Forum Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://www.clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero Club</A>||||reg||14
Z||000002||AusFiero||07-05-2001||09:12 AM||||Or if worried about the noise take the firewall carpet out on the inside and add more insulation there instead, reinstall the carpet and it should be sweet.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||1
